title: LibrarianDialogue_01
position: -22,-169
tags:
---
<<declare $customerName = "???">>
<<declare $hasHubQBeenStated = false>>
{$customerName}: "..."
{$customerName}: "..."

-> [Hello?]
-> [Can I help you?]

{$customerName}: "Huh? Oh, my bad!"
{$customerName}: "Got a bit distracted by this tome, hehe."
<<jump LibrarianHub>>
===

title: LibrarianHub
---
<<set_start_node Customer "LibrarianHub">>
<<if $hasHubQBeenStated is false>>
    {$customerName}: "Anyway... Can I get something that'll help me keep awake at night? Gotta watch all the books and stuff like that."
    <<set $hasHubQBeenStated = true>>
<<else>>
    {$customerName}: "Anything else you need to know?"
<<endif>>

-> [Give Potion] <<if $isHoldingPotion is true>>
    <<jump LibrarGivePotion>>
-> [What's your name?]{talk_cost("LibrarName")} <<if can_talk("LibrarName")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount Customer LibrarName>>
    <<jump LibrarName>>
-> [What can you tell me about Black Shard?]{talk_cost("LibrarBlackShard")} <<if can_talk("LibrarBlackShard")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount Customer LibrarBlackShard>>
    <<jump LibrarBlackShard>>
-> [What's that tome you're holding?]{talk_cost("LibrarTome")} <<if can_talk("LibrarTome")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount Customer LibrarTome>>
    <<jump LibrarTome>>
-> [How "awake" do you want to be, exactly?]{talk_cost("LibrarAwake")} <<if can_talk("LibrarAwake")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount Customer LibrarAwake>>
    <<jump LibrarAwake>>
-> [Small talk]
    <<jump LibrarSmallTalk>>
-> [Exit]
    <<jump LibrarLeaveTalk>>
===

title: LibrarName
---
{$customerName}: "Oops! Completely forgot about that part, hehe..."
<<set $customerName = "Oora">>
{$customerName}: "I'm Oora. Oora the librarian!"
{$customerName} : "Yep, been running the town library for three generations now. Kinda a big deal around town, y'know?"

-> [Can you tell me more about the library?]
    <<jump LibrarLibrary>>
-> [I see. Thank you.]
    <<jump LibrarianHub>>
===

title: LibrarLibrary
---
{$customerName}: "Why, we're only the finest archive of magic there is!"
{$customerName}: "Transmutation, conjuration, revelation, elemental magic..."
{$customerName}: "You need it, we have it!"
{$customerName}: "Well, everything EXCEPT necromancy. Kind of a big no-no amongst the family."
-> [I see... Thank you.]
<<jump LibrarianHub>>
===

title: LibrarBlackShard
---
{$customerName}: "Ooh, yikes! Poisonous. VERY poisonous."
{$customerName}: "Or, well... SOMETIMES it's poisonous."
{$customerName}: "Other times, when counteracted with something light and fuzzy..."
{$customerName}: "...It actually acts as an antidote for poison!"
-> [I see... Thank you.]
<<jump LibrarianHub>>
===

title: LibrarTome
---
{$customerName}: "Huh? Oh, this dusty old thing?"
{$customerName}: "Bah, don't worry about it. Doubt you could help out with it much, anyway..."
-> [Is it a necromancy tome?]
    {$customerName}: "Nope! Good guess, though."
-> [Is it a transfiguration tome?]
    {$customerName}: "Actually, yes! How'd you figure that one out?"
    {$customerName}: "Huh... Guess you know more about this stuff than I thought."
    {$customerName}: "Better keep that in mind!"

// Merge Both paths pls
-> [I see... Thank you.]
<<jump LibrarianHub>>
===

title: LibrarAwake
---
{$customerName}: "Oh, you know, just something that'll help me, like... y'know?"
-> [No, not really]
    {$customerName}: "Bah, you're the apothecary here! I'm sure you'll figure something out."
-> [Help with what, exactly?]
    {$customerName}: "Help me keep awake, silly! Must've not heard me the first time, heh..."
-> [Any suggestions for ingredients?]
    {$customerName}: "Oh, I don't know... Something a little spicy, maybe?"
    {$customerName}: "Oh! And something that'll help me spot any intruders that come at night. That work for ya?"

// Merge all paths pls
-> [I see.. Thank you.]
<<jump LibrarianHub>>
===

title: LibrarSmallTalk
---
{$customerName}: "ACHOO! Dearie me, it's a little dusty in here, isn't it?"
-> [Bless you.]
<<jump LibrarianHub>>
===

title: LibrarLeaveTalk
---
{$customerName}: "Don't keep me waiting too long, 'kay?"
===

title: LibrarGivePotion
---
{$customerName}: "Hmmm, now let's see here..."
<<grade_potion Customer>>
<<if $isPotionPassable is true>>
    {$customerName}: "Ooh, very nice! I feel more alert already!"
    {$customerName}: "Thanks, dearie~!"
<<else>>
    {$customerName}: "I don't know... Something about this seems... Off."
    {$customerName}: "Like, it'll help, but it won't keep me, like... AWAKE awake, y'know?"
    {$customerName}: "Oh well! Guess I'll take it anyway!"
<<endif>>
<<customer_leave Customer>>
===